## look.soar -- thor-soar: 1 proposal.

## Propose look.
## Propose looking up or down
## (The current desired is to execute this action)
sp {propose*look*up*down*mea
    :default
   (state <s> ^problem-space.name thor-world
              ^flags.mea-operator-selection true
              ^desireds <desireds>)
   (<desireds> ^desired <desired>
               ^unachieved <desired>)
   (<desired> ^executed-action <action>)
   (<action> ^action-handle look
             ^argument1 { <direction> << up down >> })
-->
   (<s> ^operator <operator> +)
   (<operator> ^name look
               ^task-operator true
               ^super-desired <desired>
               ^action-handle look
               ^argument-count 1
               ^argument1 <direction>
               ^pre-conditions-satisfied true)
}
